  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: R10
  Title: 'Window: drawn anywhere'
  Summary: A popped-out animation is drawn by its window, whatever is selected.
  Watch: Ball
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1709276710}
  HowTo: Select this tile, press <b>Pop Out</b> on an animation, and follow its Notes,
    shown in the window. Record with the red dot at the end of a From or To row,
    pose, then Finish.
  Expect: The line, dots and path stay drawn and draggable with something else selected;
    the path editor stays on; a preview from the window keeps playing.
