  Animations:
  - Name: Wiggle
    Notes: 'Record both To''s, pose the Box, Finish, then Ctrl+Z once: both values
      go back. Record again and press Cancel: nothing is written and the Box goes
      back. Record again and enter play mode: that cancels too. Record again, select
      another object, then come back: still recording.'
