  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3269ab77e5738674b9fefab358f453ff, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: R12
  Title: Undo, Cancel, play mode
  Summary: 'How a recording ends: Finish then Undo, Cancel, play mode, and selecting
    away.'
  Watch: Box
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 2119220777}
  HowTo: Select this tile, press <b>Pop Out</b> on an animation, and follow its Notes,
    shown in the window. Record with the red dot at the end of a From or To row,
    pose, then Finish.
  Expect: 'One Ctrl+Z undoes a whole recording and leaves the Box at rest. Cancel
    and play mode write nothing and put the Box back (play mode also warns in the
