    <b>Preview On</b>. Press Pop Out on Slide there, and follow its Notes.
  Expect: Pop Out works from the set's Inspector with Preview On filled; Finish writes
    into Record Set.asset. The Ball's player shows no Pop Out under Shared Animations
    (read-only there).
